# drivingbot

> **inDriver automation bot** — Python reimplementation reverse-engineered from FLASHBOT 5.164.0.

---

## What it does

`drivingbot` monitors inDriver's real-time order stream (WebSocket) and automatically accepts passenger orders that match your price and zone filters — the same behaviour implemented by FLASHBOT's native bot layer.

## Architecture

```
drivingbot/
├── src/drivingbot/
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── client.py       ← InDriverAuth + InDriverOrderAPI (mirrors AuthManager)
│   │   └── stream.py       ← WebSocket stream (mirrors FloatingStatus service)
│   ├── bot/
│   │   ├── order_handler.py ← Main loop (mirrors SuperbotButton + bot core)
│   │   └── price_engine.py  ← Price filter (mirrors PricePreference)
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── settings.py     ← BotConfig (mirrors ConfigManager + all prefs)
│   ├── zone/
│   │   └── zone_manager.py ← Zone filter (mirrors ZoneMapUtility)
│   └── cli.py              ← Terminal UI (mirrors MainActivity + FloatingStatus)
├── tests/
├── ANALYSIS.md             ← Full reverse engineering report
└── decompiled/             ← jadx output (83,364 files from APK)
```

## Quick start

```bash
# Install
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Configure
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env: set DRIVINGBOT_PHONE, DRIVINGBOT_CITY_ID, price filters

# Login (OTP)
drivingbot login

# Start bot
drivingbot start

# Show config
drivingbot status

# Add working zone
drivingbot zone add z1 --name "Zona Colonial" --lat 18.47 --lon -69.95 --radius 5.0

# Run tests
pytest
```

## Configuration

All settings via `.env` file (prefix: `DRIVINGBOT_`):

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `DRIVINGBOT_PHONE` | — | Driver phone with country code |
| `DRIVINGBOT_TOKEN` | — | Auth token (set by `login` command) |
| `DRIVINGBOT_CITY_ID` | 0 | inDriver city ID |
| `DRIVINGBOT_PRICE__MIN_PRICE` | 0 | Minimum order price (0 = any) |
| `DRIVINGBOT_PRICE__MAX_PRICE` | 0 | Maximum order price (0 = no limit) |
| `DRIVINGBOT_PRICE__AUTO_NEGOTIATE` | false | Counter-offer when below min |
| `DRIVINGBOT_PRICE__NEGOTIATE_INCREMENT_PCT` | 10.0 | Counter-offer increment % |
| `DRIVINGBOT_ZONE__ENABLED_ZONES` | (all) | Comma-separated zone IDs |
| `DRIVINGBOT_ZONE__MAX_DISTANCE_KM` | 0 | Max pickup distance (0 = any) |
| `DRIVINGBOT_ACCEPT_DELAY_MS` | 300 | Delay before accepting (anti-detection) |

